config CONTROLLER_ENABLE
    bool "M6 QUAD controller (MPC/SO3/rate PID/allocation)"
    default n
    help
      Builds the fixed 15-variable/190-row OSQP 1.0.0 embedded solver,
      QUAD LTI ControlModelPort and ControllerPort. GNU Arm toolchain only.
      The 50 Hz integrator calls control_outer_update separately from the 1 kHz
      controller_update. This option does not create threads or enable motors.
      Target WCET and board/vehicle calibration remain unverified.
